## Why This Problem Is Asked
This problem combines prefix DP with an inner backward sweep to compute the optimal segment ending at each position. It tests understanding of state decomposition, reconstruction logic, and handles edge cases like negative values naturally.

## Key Concepts
- DP state: dp[i][t] tracks the optimal value using the first i elements with t segments
- Inner loop: expanding the left boundary computes segment maximum on the fly
- Reconstruction: store predecessor pointers to recover exact subarray boundaries
- Complexity: O(n²k) time, O(nk) space

## Code Example
```javascript
function maxValueSubarrays(A, k) {
    const n = A.length;
    const dp = Array(n + 1).fill(null).map(() => Array(k + 1).fill(-Infinity));
    const prev = Array(n + 1).fill(null).map(() => Array(k + 1).fill(0));
    dp[0][0] = 0;

    for (let i = 1; i <= n; i++) {
        for (let t = 1; t <= k; t++) {
            let curMax = -Infinity;
            for (let l = i; l >= 1; l--) {
                curMax = Math.max(curMax, A[l - 1]);
                const val = (dp[l - 1][t - 1] !== -Infinity ? dp[l - 1][t - 1] + curMax : -Infinity);
                if (val > dp[i][t]) {
                    dp[i][t] = val;
                    prev[i][t] = l;
                }
            }
        }
    }

    const result = [];
    let i = n, t = k;
    while (t > 0 && i > 0) {
        const l = prev[i][t];
        result.unshift([l, i]);
        i = l - 1;
        t--;
    }
    return { value: dp[n][k], boundaries: result };
}
```

## Why This Is Asked
New angle: exactly k non-overlapping subarrays maximize sum, a knapsack-like DP variant with efficient inner maximization. It mirrors budgeted promotion planning.

## Key Concepts
- DP state: dp[i][t] is the best total for first i elements using t blocks
- Prefix sums P enable O(1) subarray sums
- Optimize inner max with best = max(dp[j-1][t-1]-P[j-1]) up to i
- Reconstruction via pointers to endpoints

## Code Example
```javascript
function maxKSubarrays(a,k){
  const n=a.length;
  const P=[0];
  for(let v of a) P.push(P[P.length-1]+v);
  const dp=Array.from({length:n+1},()=>Array(k+1).fill(-Infinity));
  dp[0].fill(0);
  for(let t=1;t<=k;t++){
    let best=-Infinity;
    for(let i=1;i<=n;i++){
      dp[i][t]=dp[i-1][t];
      best=Math.max(best, dp[i-1][t-1]-P[i-1]);
      const cand=P[i]+best;
      if(cand>dp[i][t]) dp[i][t]=cand;
    }
  }
  return dp[n][k];
}
```

